  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Women in Politics</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to empower women in politics overseas, bringing together women Members of Parliament from developing countries around the world to celebrate their achievements and challenges, discuss how to strengthen visibility, build peer networks and empower women parliamentarians to drive change and gender equality in their countries and internationally.</narrative>
